2. Constructor Me Validation (Safeguards)

Constructor me hum conditions laga sakte hain taaki sirf valid object hi create ho.

Example
class PlayerCharacter:

    def __init__(self, name, age):

        if age > 18:
            self.name = name
            self.age = age
Explanation

Yahan check ho raha hai:

Age > 18 ?

