Q1. What is a Class Method?

A Class Method is a method that belongs to the class instead of an object. It is created using the @classmethod decorator and receives cls as its first parameter.

Q2. What is a Static Method?

A Static Method is a method that does not access the class or object. It is created using the @staticmethod decorator.

Q3. Difference Between self and cls?
self → Refers to the current object (instance).
cls → Refers to the current class.

🔥 Quick Revision
@classmethod class ke liye method banata hai.
Class Method ka first parameter cls hota hai.
Class Method ko object ke bina call kar sakte hain.
Class Method se naye objects bhi create kiye ja sakte hain (cls()).
@staticmethod ek normal utility function hota hai jo class ke andar likha jata hai.
Static Method me na self hota hai aur na hi cls.



