Why Use Dunder Methods?

Ye methods hamari class ko Python ke built-in objects (list, dict, string, etc.) ki tarah behave karne ki ability dete hain.


Important Dunder Methods
Dunder Method	Use
__init__()	Constructor
__str__()	print() / String representation
__len__()	len()
__call__()	Object ko function ki tarah call karna
__getitem__()	[] indexing/access
__del__()	Object delete hone par call




